These are treasure loot that drop from most challenging monsters in Classic Everquest. Typically they can be found on monsters in the level 45+ range in places like [[Kedge Keep]], [[The Hole]], [[Plane of Fear]] and [[Plane of Hate]].  The gems can be used for [[Jewelcrafting]] but they are typically just sold to vendors.

